{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/9wvi1oze","slide":2,"text":"Proof of readiness","textPreview":"Proof of readiness","textChars":18,"textLines":1,"bbox":[852,246,300,46]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ovm1sjyt","slide":2,"text":"Learners need a defensible next action—not another opaque score.","textPreview":"Learners need a defensible next action—not another opaque score.","textChars":64,"textLines":1,"bbox":[852,306,300,94]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/7qhkbixs","slide":2,"bbox":[64,466,1114,144]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/6p8j2dg7","slide":2,"text":"Fursah joins those streams into one traceable chain: evidence → inference → readiness → action.","textPreview":"Fursah joins those streams into one traceable chain: evidence → inference → readiness → action.","textChars":95,"textLines":1,"bbox":[96,496,1050,68]}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/p02wfz","slide":2,"text":"The problem is not lack of data. It is fragmentation. Fursah unifies academic evidence, role requirements, and proof of readiness so every recommendation has a visible reason and a next action."}
